# A changed projection definition adopted forward without a rebuild keeps the
# contributions the old definition extracted.
MODULE: IntendedContributionDefinitionAdoptedForward
TARGET: IntendedContribution
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the view adopts the new definition without rebuilding
PERTURBS: ChangeDefinition

--- FIND
    /\ defn = 1 /\ defn' = 2
    /\ UNCHANGED <<appended, target, phys, stored, wal, intended, submitted,
         mustRefuse, replicated, retried, rw, cap, promised>>
    /\ UNCHANGED view
--- REPLACE
    /\ defn = 1 /\ defn' = 2
    /\ UNCHANGED <<appended, target, phys, stored, wal, intended, submitted,
         mustRefuse, replicated, retried, rw, cap, promised>>
    /\ viewDefn' = 2
    /\ UNCHANGED <<bound, genCopy, read, checkpoint, mem, slots, applied, faults,
         reconciles, barrier>>
--- END
